    "The four actual Miller operands are(-A,B),(alpha,beta),(vk_x,gamma),(C,delta), with a literal Fp12 unit for neutral vk_x. Three actual products and the negative-seed conjugation are bound.",
    "Finite G1 y-coordinates are nonzero under the odd full G1 order. Regular G2 line coefficients have nonzero c2, so the independent014 basis gives nonzero line values and a nonzero complete pairing product.",
    "Independent tower character calculations establish the standard Fp2/Fp6/Fp12 irreducibility, conditional on the standard prime p. The actual inlined quadratic/cubic norm and adjugate operations therefore give a valid inverse of the nonzero pairing product.",
    "Actual easy-part operands produce W=f^((p^6-1)(p^2+1)). Since p^12-1=easy*Phi12, W and every downstream hard-chain operand lie in the required cyclotomic subgroup.",
    "The compiled cyclotomic square is independently certified by exact linear combinations of18 norm/Frobenius polynomial constraints. The signed-x power loop and all actual hard-chain tuples, including inline Frobenius1/3 constants, are bound.",
    "The exact resulting exponent is3*(p^12-1)/r. The actual12 terminal comparisons require the unit. Since gcd(3,r)=1, this has exactly the standard final-exponent unit kernel."
